suit. The honor tile offers no development potential and appears relatively safe given the discard history.\\n\\nReason: \\nF1 is an isolated honor tile that provides no hand development potential. With two F1 already discarded by the next player and one F1 discarded by me earlier, it's relatively safe. My hand needs to maintain suited tiles for better flexibility in forming chows. Discarding F1 keeps maximum potential for developing sequences in all three suits (T4-T5, B1-B2, B6-B8-B9).\\n\\nAnswer: Play F1\"}"}
